This project contains a fork of Immich (https://github.com/immich-app/immich),
copyright the Immich contributors, also licensed under AGPL-3.0. The forked
code lives in immich/ — principally the web client (immich/web) and the mobile
app (immich/mobile) — and has been modified to talk to a Cloudflare Worker
backed by Telegram storage instead of the upstream Immich server.

If you want a conventional self-hosted photo server on your own hardware, use
Immich itself. It is excellent, and this project would not exist without it.

